Intuitively, I think I would like to see an additional component of the "session" object that could be accessed via session$user.

The value would be NA for all shiny apps running outside of shinyapps.io <http://shinyapps.io> and for all shinyapps.io <http://shinyapps.io> "Public" applications.

For shinyapps.io <http://shinyapps.io> "Private" applications, the object would be populations with the userid (i.e. email address) of the authenticated application user.

Is there something that gets me close to this within the existing shiny/shinyapps.io <http://shinyapps.io> framework or should this be a feature request?

