How about a local spark cluster? Is it possible to connect to a local spark cluster with the spark package pre-installed?

On Wednesday, November 30, 2016 at 2:58:11 AM UTC+11, Joshua Spiewak wrote:
> Unfortunately, there is no ability to connect to a remote spark cluster from shinyapps.io <http://shinyapps.io> today, due mostly to the fact that the performance of the integration requires that the R Process be next to the Spark cluster.
>
> However, I know that the team working on sparklyr is looking at a solution that would enable an R process to work against a remote cluster. Once that is available, you should be able to use shinyapps.io <http://shinyapps.io> to connect to your Spark cluster.
>

